---
title: Music Recommender System Architecture
---
flowchart TD
    note["Input: listening profile + songs.csv<br>Process: score, retrieve, generate, verify<br>Output: recommendation + grounded explanation"]

    U["User<br>(CLI main.py / Streamlit app.py)"] -->|listening profile + songs.csv| LOAD["Loader<br>recommender.load_songs()"]

    LOAD --> SCORE["Recommender<br>recommender.recommend_songs()<br>(feature-weighted scoring)"]

    subgraph RAG["RAG Explanation Pipeline (explain.py)"]
        direction TB
        RET["Retriever<br>retrieval.KnowledgeBase<br>(TF-IDF over genre/mood/song notes)"]
        GEN["Generator<br>Claude API call<br>(explanation constrained to retrieved docs)"]
        GROUND{"Groundedness Check<br>groundedness.score_groundedness()"}
        FALLBACK["Deterministic Fallback Explanation<br>(always-safe, no LLM)"]

        RET -->|retrieved documents| GEN
        GEN --> GROUND
        GROUND -->|grounded| OUT_EXP["Final Explanation"]
        GROUND -->|not grounded / API unavailable| FALLBACK
        FALLBACK --> OUT_EXP
    end

    SCORE -->|top-N recommended songs| RAG
    SCORE -->|match reasons & scores| GEN

    OUT_EXP --> RESULT["Recommendation + Explanation"]
    RESULT --> U

    subgraph HUMAN["Human-in-the-loop / Testing"]
        direction TB
        REVIEW["Human review of explanations<br>(manual spot-check in Streamlit UI)"]
        TESTS["Automated tests<br>(unit tests on scoring, retrieval,<br>groundedness thresholds)"]
    end

    RESULT -.->|user reads & judges quality| REVIEW
    GROUND -.->|automated acceptance gate| TESTS
    TESTS -.->|pass/fail feedback| RAG
